<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Fast attention mechanisms: a tale of parallelism" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>ANNA-transformer Solves <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>-hop and <span class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath">Match2</span></span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A6.SS1" title="In Appendix F ANNA-transformer Solves 𝑘-hop and Match2 ‣ Fast attention mechanisms: a tale of parallelism" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F.1 </span>ANNA/EMA-transformer Solves <span class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath">Match2</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A6.SS2" title="In Appendix F ANNA-transformer Solves 𝑘-hop and Match2 ‣ Fast attention mechanisms: a tale of parallelism" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F.2 </span>ANN transformer Solves <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>-hop</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A7" title="In Fast attention mechanisms: a tale of parallelism" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G </span>Experimental details</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
