<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A7.SS1.SSS0.Px1" title="In G.1 Match2 experiments ‣ Appendix G Experimental details ‣ Fast attention mechanisms: a tale of parallelism" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Dataset generation.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A7.SS1.SSS0.Px2" title="In G.1 Match2 experiments ‣ Appendix G Experimental details ‣ Fast attention mechanisms: a tale of parallelism" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Training details.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
